  <reporting-org ref="XI-IATI-IADB" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inter-American Development Bank</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Decontamination of Critical Areas</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Descontaminacin de Areas Crticas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del Programa es contribuir a sentar las bases para la descontaminacin ambiental en el pas a travs del establecimiento y consolidacin de mecanismos de gestin ambiental en tres reas temticas crticas: contaminacin del aire, contaminacin del agua y contaminacin por desechos slidos. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) contar en cada una de estas reas crticas con mecanismos de informacin y monitoreo funcionando, con normas de calidad y reglamentos establecidos, con una capacidad institucional fortalecida del MARN, con sistemas de permisos y auditoras ambientales funcionando, y con estrategias y planes de descontaminacin especficos; y (ii) iniciar inversiones de descontaminacin en desechos slidos municipales.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the programme is to help lay the groundwork for the environmental cleanup in the country through the establishment and consolidation of mechanisms for environmental management in three critical thematic areas: air pollution, water pollution and solid waste pollution. The specific objectives are: (i) count in each of these areas with critical information and monitoring mechanisms to operate, with quality standards and regulations established, with a strengthened institutional capacity of MARN, with systems operating permits and environmental audits, and with strategies and specific plans for decontamination, and (ii) initiating investments in municipal solid waste decontamination.</narrative>
  </description>
